Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Every family has a beginning. Ours\Nbegins at the old walls of Harar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.07,0:00:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My great-grandparents came here from far\Naway, carrying little more than a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My great-grandfather was a tailor on\NMakina Girgir, the street of sewing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandmother kept a small stall by the\Nstreet. The stitches became trade, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the trade became a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What she earned, she saved, for the ones\Nwho would come after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.23,0:00:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother helped her at the stall by\Nday, and carried her schoolbooks with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At night, when she was tired, she\Nstudied anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And one day, she graduated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:01:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she worked long hours in a\Ngovernment office, and gave everything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,she had so that I could learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I graduated in software engineering with\Nhonours, won a scholarship for my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,master's, and today I am an AI engineer,\Nwith comforts they never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I have is mine alone. It is the\Nwork of everyone who came before me. Now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it is my turn to take us a little\Nfurther.
